  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline SNAPAHOLIC is the debut blend in the Chef's Choice series curated by Coach Conor Casey. It combines Snapper 1.23 Lavender in the mains with O-TORO SNAP TOUR FLEX 1.25 Mint in the crosses. The octagonal Snapper mains create aggressive mechanical bite and spin, while the ultra-slick round crosses reduce inter-string friction and allow the mains to slide and return rapidly. The result is a crisp, elastic and lively hybrid designed for fast swings, explosive spin, strong snapback and consistent modern control.",

    "zh": "Toroline SNAPAHOLIC 是 Chef's Choice 系列的首款 Hybrid，由 Coach Conor Casey 策划。主线使用 Snapper 1.23 Lavender，以八边形结构提供强机械咬球和旋转；横线使用 O-TORO SNAP TOUR FLEX 1.25 Mint，以超光滑圆形结构降低主横线摩擦，并提升主线滑动和快速回位。整体形成一套 Crisp、Elastic、Lively 的现代 Spin Hybrid，特别适合高速挥拍、追求爆发旋转、强 Snapback 和稳定控制的球员。"
  },

